msgstr "Detiene su contenedor hasta que vuelva a iniciarlo."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Start…"
msgstr "Iniciar…"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Start Android"
msgstr "Iniciar Android"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Starts its container and opens Android's own screen."
msgstr "Inicia su contenedor y abre la pantalla de Android."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Drawing tablets"
msgstr "Tabletas gráficas"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
