#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Virus scan found something"
msgstr "El análisis antivirus encontró algo"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "It was moved to quarantine. See it, or put it back, with: ame security scan"
msgstr "Se movió a cuarentena. Puede verse, o devolverse a su sitio, con: ame security scan"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "It was deleted. See what it was with: ame security scan"
msgstr "Se eliminó. Puede verse qué era con: ame security scan"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Nothing was deleted, quarantined or moved. See it with: ame security scan"
msgstr "No se eliminó, puso en cuarentena ni movió nada. Puede verse con: ame security scan"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Virus scan could not run"
msgstr "No se pudo ejecutar el análisis antivirus"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "This machine has not been scanned. Try it with: ame security scan"
msgstr "Este equipo no se ha analizado. Pruébalo con: ame security scan"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
#, sh-format
msgid "Virus signatures are ${AGE} days old"
msgstr "Las firmas de virus tienen ${AGE} días"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "A clean scan proves nothing with signatures this old. Check this machine's network connection."
msgstr "Un análisis limpio no prueba nada con firmas tan antiguas. Revisa la conexión de red de este equipo."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "No virus signatures on this machine"
msgstr "No hay firmas de virus en este equipo"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "clamav-freshclam.service has never finished a download, so nothing has been scanned yet."
msgstr "clamav-freshclam.service nunca ha terminado una descarga, así que aún no se ha analizado nada."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Security audit could not run"
msgstr "No se pudo ejecutar la auditoría de seguridad"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Run it by hand with: ame security audit"
msgstr "Ejecútala a mano con: ame security audit"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "The security watcher could not run"
msgstr "No se pudo ejecutar el vigilante de seguridad"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Nothing is reading the audit log until it does. See why with: journalctl -u amethystora-security-watch.service"
msgstr "Nada lee el registro de auditoría hasta que se ejecute. Puede verse por qué con: journalctl -u amethystora-security-watch.service"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Network protection stopped"
msgstr "La protección de red se detuvo"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
msgid "Connections work, but nothing inspects them. See why with: journalctl -u amethystora-ips.service"
msgstr "Las conexiones funcionan, pero nada las inspecciona. Puede verse por qué con: journalctl -u amethystora-ips.service"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
#, sh-format
msgid "${UNIT} failed"
msgstr "${UNIT} falló"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-scan-alert
#, sh-format
msgid "See: systemctl status ${UNIT}"
msgstr "Véase: systemctl status ${UNIT}"

