msgstr "La barra superior en bloques de los colores del tema"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Dark glass outlined and glowing in the theme's accent"
msgstr "Vidrio oscuro con contorno y resplandor en el acento del tema"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Estilo"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The shape of the top bar, menus, notifications, dialogs, buttons and windows."
msgstr "La forma de la barra superior, los menús, las notificaciones, los diálogos, los botones y las ventanas."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Amethystora UI is not installed."
msgstr "Amethystora UI no está instalado."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while Reduce transparency is on."
msgstr "El vidrio se dibuja sólido mientras Reducir la transparencia está activado."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while High Contrast is on."
msgstr "El vidrio se dibuja sólido mientras Alto contraste está activado."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while the power saver is on."
msgstr "El vidrio se dibuja sólido mientras el ahorro de energía está activado."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Frost"
msgstr "Escarcha"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Thick, milky glass with an even tint"
msgstr "Vidrio grueso y lechoso con un tinte uniforme"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Prism"
msgstr "Prisma"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
