msgstr "Los recordatorios de GNOME para apartar la vista o levantarse. Las horas están en Ajustes, Bienestar."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Quiet while fullscreen or sharing"
msgstr "Silencio en pantalla completa o al compartir"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Banners wait while a window is fullscreen or the screen is shared or recorded. Calls, alarms and urgent ones still come through."
msgstr "Los avisos esperan mientras una ventana está a pantalla completa o la pantalla se comparte o se graba. Las llamadas, las alarmas y los urgentes siguen llegando."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "From sunset to sunrise."
msgstr "Del atardecer al amanecer."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
#, sh-format
msgid "Now ${FROM} to ${TO}."
msgstr "Ahora de ${FROM} a ${TO}."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Quiet at night"
msgstr "Silencio por la noche"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Banners wait between Night Light's times."
msgstr "Los avisos esperan durante las horas de Luz nocturna."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Digest"
msgstr "Resumen"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Banners that are not urgent wait and come together, as one card, at the times you choose."
msgstr "Los avisos que no son urgentes esperan y llegan juntos, en una sola tarjeta, a las horas que elija."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "12:00 and 18:00"
msgstr "12:00 y 18:00"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "09:00, 13:00 and 17:00"
msgstr "09:00, 13:00 y 17:00"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "08:00, 12:00, 16:00 and 20:00"
msgstr "08:00, 12:00, 16:00 y 20:00"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "18:00"
msgstr "18:00"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
#, sh-format
msgid "Set from a terminal: ${SHOWN}."
msgstr "Establecido desde una terminal: ${SHOWN}."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Digest times"
msgstr "Horas del resumen"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "When the digest comes."
msgstr "Cuándo llega el resumen."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Later and mute"
msgstr "Más tarde y silenciar"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Later on any banner brings it back in an hour, this evening, tomorrow or when you next unlock; Mute holds an app's banners for an hour."
msgstr "Más tarde en cualquier aviso lo devuelve en una hora, esta tarde, mañana o la próxima vez que desbloquee; Silenciar retiene los avisos de una aplicación durante una hora."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "18:00 and 09:00"
msgstr "18:00 y 09:00"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "19:00 and 08:00"
msgstr "19:00 y 08:00"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "17:00 and 08:30"
msgstr "17:00 y 08:30"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "This evening and tomorrow morning"
msgstr "Esta tarde y mañana por la mañana"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "When Later's This evening and Tomorrow morning bring a banner back."
msgstr "Cuándo Esta tarde y Mañana por la mañana de Más tarde devuelven un aviso."

