msgid "Sleep at Night Light's times"
msgstr "Sueño a las horas de Luz nocturna"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Sleep turns on at Night Light's evening time and ends at its morning time."
msgstr "Sueño se activa a la hora de la tarde de Luz nocturna y termina a su hora de la mañana."

